{"ID":"20240220132625-neb8mr3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132625-neb8mr3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132625-neb8mr3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163628-8zf0kk4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163628-xde7nhu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163628-xde7nhu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:83,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:83\u0026#125;","title":"【柴胡桂枝汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312163628-8zf0kk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-8zf0kk4","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百六十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-8g1ttgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-8g1ttgw","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」六七日,发热微恶寒,支节烦疼,微呕,心下支结,外证未去者,「柴胡桂枝汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-wu5qyz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-wu5qyz6","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「伤寒」六七日,发热微恶寒,支节烦疼,这里看起来麻黄汤症没有问题。心下支结，代表心下有苦满的现象。外证未去者,这个时候要用柴胡桂枝汤，不要用柴胡麻黄汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-9zdzf90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-9zdzf90","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒失治七天后，进入少阳，出现少阳症的时候，不要再用麻黄了。所以经方里面看不到柴胡麻黄汤，只看到柴胡桂枝汤。因为麻黄汤是在皮肤表面上，很外层的，表邪下陷以后，它就在肌肉里面，所以桂枝汤是对的。因为半表半里所以才用柴胡，柴胡麻黄各用一半的剂量。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-43p55aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-43p55aw","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡桂枝汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-5z0mucs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-5z0mucs","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡一两半,桂枝一两半去皮,黄芩一两半,人参一两半,甘草一两炙,半夏二合半洗,芍药一两半,大枣六枚劈,生姜一两半切。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-s5r9kdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-s5r9kdc","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右九味,以水七升,煮取三升,去滓,温服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-t8yypkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-t8yypkx","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小柴胡汤与桂枝汤是等量。等量的意思是说正好这个表邪下陷的时候它走在中间，一半在太阳，一半在少阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-m8fpkci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-m8fpkci","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用麻黄汤一定是很确定病在表，完全是在皮肤上面。这里是只要邪不在表面上面，一律不用麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-x7i2cjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-x7i2cjc","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上不能刚刚好一半在太阳一半在少阳，你问病人怕风比较多，恶心比较多，怕风比较多，你不能说让他回去等一半的时候再来，一般我们遇到这种处方的时候，不用考虑，小柴胡汤是和解的方剂，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在遇到半表半里的时候，我一般重用柴胡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我不管他是到什么程度，原方会用等量，那我会用柴胡，重用柴胡有时到三钱四钱。因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡也可以发汗，柴胡本来设计的就是在半表半里中间"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一加重柴胡的时候，会把桂枝推上去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，桂枝柴胡合力就会发表汗，会比各半汤的时候发汗来的多。如果没有加柴胡，大部分是从小便利掉。临床上我是重用柴胡，它能通利三焦，是三阳主要的药物。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-1rcw754","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-1rcw754","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最好的柴胡是一半在土里面，一半长在外面，这一节最好。我们用这一节柴胡就半表半里。因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡能通利三焦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而三焦在中医的定义当然是上焦、中焦、下焦。实际上这个三焦通到奇恒之腑，包括女人的女子胞，子宫卵巢，脑，骨髓，内脏之间，心包，胆，和脏腑之间的油网统统属于三焦。都是需要柴胡。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-ty6o72b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-ty6o72b","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位不要看病名，我曾经用柴胡桂枝汤，就是加一味牡蛎，就把淋巴肿瘤去掉了。同样是柴胡桂枝汤，但是他是喉咙上面甲状腺，我还是加牡蛎。淋巴腺甲状腺我们同样用牡蛎攻坚，同样都好。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163628-xde7nhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163628-xde7nhu","updated":"20240312163628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你不知道这个少阳跟太阳的处方可以并用，微呕,心下支结,你开小柴胡汤，吃完以后，病人恶心，心下支满没有，表症还有一点，桂枝汤症。你可以分两次，先吃小柴胡再吃桂枝汤。"}]}]}